                      <tbody><tr align="left"> 
                        <td> 
                          <p><font face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="3">Below 
                            is a petition <a href="/sites/pmwatch.org/index.html" class="dead" aria-disabled="true">Palestine 
                            Media Watch</a> will be faxing to all the major US 
                            media outlets in North America, every single Thursday 
                            starting on Thursday, January 3, 2002. The petition 
                            details the major journalistic breaches US editors 
                            and journalists have been guilty of and calls on them 
                            to addresses thoses breaches.</font></p>
                          <p><font face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="3">We 
                            hope that the list of signatories will grow every 
                            week. </font></p>
                          <p><font face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="3">If 
                            you have not already signed, please do now by entering 
                            your data below.</font></p>
